							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I never understood why so many folks badmouth this guy.</div><br />some of the gripes are legitimate, but in general i&#039;d say it&#039;s because so many folks are assholes.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">cuz he gives out money and gas and medicine and education to poor working folks instead of taking oil profits for big business...&nbsp; what a jerk.</div><br />i&#039;d be interested to know how much of a profit the venezuelan government is making from this deal. if you think the venezuelan government isn&#039;t a big business, you need to check yourself/the facts.<br /><br />in general, though, i dig what this dude is doing. he&#039;s an asshole, but a cleaner one than the vast majority of our world&#039;s leaders (especially cheney and the oil gang from the middle east).</div>
